	(70, '2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.25.07.65.002', 'Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Kalimantan Utara', 'Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 25 October 2026, 15:30 WITA di sebagian wilayah Kalimantan Utara, khususnya di BAHAU HULU, BETAYAU, KAYAN HILIR, LUMBIS OGONG, MENTARANG HULU, MURUK RIAN, PESO, PESO HILIR, SEBUKU, SEKATAK, SEMBAKUNG, SEMBAKUNG ATULAI, SESAYAP, SESAYAP HILIR, SUNGAI BOH, TULIN ONSOI.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 25 October 2026, 18:30 WITA.', 'Kalimantan Utara', 'https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CKU20261025002_alert.xml', 'Met', '2026-10-25 08:20:00', '2026-10-25 08:30:00', '2026-10-25 11:30:00', '["2.799,116.870 2.740,116.828 2.735,116.818 2.720,116.816 2.714,116.802 2.688,116.788 2.692,116.760 2.686,116.786 2.690,116.793 2.713,116.803 2.717,116.813 2.733,116.828 2.782,116.862 2.752,116.877 2.698,116.884 2.469,116.860 2.461,116.846 2.399,116.823 2.383,116.808 2.379,116.796 2.387,116.786 2.439,116.775 2.527,116.740 2.530,116.733 2.517,116.713 2.448,116.633 2.429,116.628 2.417,116.618 2.418,116.607 2.436,116.576 2.449,116.568 2.455,116.551 2.447,116.525 2.456,116.496 2.445,116.491 2.410,116.495 2.397,116.488 2.390,116.490 2.379,116.502 2.345,116.503 2.322,116.485 2.317,116.476 2.302,116.475 2.294,116.478 2.285,116.471 2.279,116.457 2.287,116.445 2.289,116.428 2.304,116.417 2.296,116.401 2.289,116.335 2.260,116.303 2.239,116.295 2.235,116.290 2.213,116.300 2.195,116.320 2.183,116.341 2.166,116.350 2.122,116.311 2.124,116.293 2.105,116.293 2.108,116.258 2.120,116.240 2.133,116.228 2.147,116.185 2.141,116.169 2.133,116.157 2.152,116.146 2.168,116.130 2.171,116.095 2.165,116.080 2.155,116.068 2.151,116.052 2.192,116.017 2.229,115.997 2.260,115.989 2.267