	(117, '2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.25.13.18.003', 'Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Lampung', 'Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 25 October 2026, 19:15 WIB di sebagian wilayah Lampung, khususnya di BAHUGA, BANDAR MATARAM, BLAMBANGAN PAGAR, BUMI NABUNG, GUNUNG SUGIH, KOTA AGUNG TIMUR, KOTA GAJAH, KOTABUMI SELATAN, KOTABUMI UTARA, NEGARA BATIN, PAKUAN RATU, RAMAN UTARA, RUMBIA, SEPUTIH BANYAK, SEPUTIH MATARAM, SEPUTIH RAMAN, SUNGKAI SELATAN, TERUSAN NUNYAI, WAY PANGUBUAN, WAY SEPUTIH.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 25 October 2026, 22:00 WIB.', 'Lampung', 'https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CLG20261025003_alert.xml', 'Met', '2026-10-25 12:00:00', '2026-10-25 12:15:00', '2026-10-25 15:00:00', '["-4.924,105.312 -4.925,105.301 -4.941,105.306 -4.952,105.303 -4.973,105.315 -4.980,105.310 -4.989,105.286 -4.994,105.281 -4.991,105.275 -4.993,105.249 -5.004,105.234 -5.017,105.235 -5.024,105.241 -5.032,105.236 -5.055,105.233 -5.065,105.227 -5.045,105.216 -5.043,105.188 -5.051,105.180 -5.069,105.173 -5.062,105.161 -5.062,105.145 -5.047,105.151 -5.041,105.149 -5.041,105.145 -5.027,105.145 -5.027,105.139 -5.034,105.133 -5.032,105.129 -4.999,105.106 -4.990,105.119 -4.978,105.149 -4.979,105.159 -4.968,105.180 -4.955,105.195 -4.953,105.219 -4.958,105.243 -4.947,105.256 -4.953,105.264 -4.947,105.278 -4.939,105.283 -4.915,105.288 -4.899,105.298 -4.903,105.310 -4.915,105.314 -4.924,105.312", "-4.832,105.412 -4.835,105.402 -4.853,105.397 -4.868,105.409 -4.878,105.411 -4.894,105.429 -4.904,105.424 -4.926,105.400 -4.967,105.415 -4.972,105.406 -4.969,105.395 -4.960,105.392 -4.956,105.370 -4.966,105.332 -4.965,105.328 -4.953,105.326 -4.924,105.312 -4.915,105.314 -4.903,105.310 -4.899,105.298 -4.