	(121, '2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.25.13.65.004', 'Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Kalimantan Utara', 'Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 25 October 2026, 18:30 WITA di sebagian wilayah Kalimantan Utara, khususnya di KAYAN HILIR, KAYAN HULU, KAYAN SELATAN, KRAYAN, KRAYAN BARAT, KRAYAN TIMUR, LUMBIS, LUMBIS OGONG, MENTARANG HULU, PUJUNGAN, SUNGAI BOH.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 25 October 2026, 21:30 WITA.', 'Kalimantan Utara', 'https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CKU20261025004_alert.xml', 'Met', '2026-10-25 11:20:00', '2026-10-25 11:30:00', '2026-10-25 14:30:00', '["2.872,115.954 2.871,115.953 2.870,115.952 2.867,115.950 2.853,115.948 2.852,115.948 2.848,115.945 2.846,115.942 2.844,115.940 2.842,115.938 2.840,115.933 2.839,115.931 2.827,115.920 2.824,115.919 2.819,115.922 2.816,115.925 2.812,115.930 2.810,115.934 2.805,115.937 2.801,115.939 2.799,115.940 2.797,115.941 2.794,115.942 2.791,115.944 2.787,115.947 2.769,115.969 2.765,115.974 2.760,115.975 2.757,115.977 2.752,115.979 2.749,115.981 2.747,115.980 2.745,115.980 2.737,115.980 2.737,115.980 2.734,115.980 2.731,115.977 2.729,115.975 2.728,115.975 2.726,115.972 2.721,115.963 2.717,115.963 2.712,115.964 2.709,115.964 2.705,115.967 2.702,115.970 2.699,115.975 2.697,115.979 2.697,115.988 2.697,115.988 2.695,115.988 2.694,115.988 2.693,115.987 2.685,115.985 2.684,115.986 2.684,115.986 2.685,116.007 2.687,116.021 2.687,116.025 2.688,116.039 2.688,116.048 2.690,116.058 2.695,116.076 2.699,116.085 2.701,116.098 2.698,116.111 2.689,116.124 2.688,116.130 2.688,116.134 2.686,116.143 2.686,116.146 2.685,116.156 2.685,116.162 2.683,116.181 2.683,116.187 2.686,116.205 2.687,116.213 2.689,116.226 2.691,116.236 2.692,116.240 2