	(123, '2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.25.13.11.005', 'Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Aceh', 'Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 25 October 2026, 16:44 WIB di sebagian wilayah Aceh, khususnya di ARONGAN LAMBALEK, ATU LINTANG, BABAH ROT, BABUL MAKMUR, BABUL RAHMAH, BABUSSALAM, BAITURRAHMAN, BAITUSSALAM, BAKONGAN, BAKONGAN TIMUR, BAMBEL, BANDA RAYA, BANDAR BARU, BANDAR PUSAKA, BEUTONG, BEUTONG ATEUH BANGGALANG, BIREM BAYEUN, BLANG BINTANG, BLANG PIDIE, BLANGJERANGO, BLANGKEJEREN, BLANGPEGAYON, BUBON, BUKIT TUSAM, CELALA, DABUN GELANG, DANAU PARIS, DARUL HASANAH, DARUL HIKMAH, DARUL IMARAH, DARUL KAMAL, DARUL MAKMUR, DARUSSALAM, DELENG POKHKISEN, DELIMA, GEULUMPANG TIGA, GEUREDONG PASE, GLUMPANG BARO, GRONG-GRONG, GUNUNG MERIAH, INDRA JAYA, INDRA JAYA, INDRAPURI, INGIN JAYA, JAGONG JEGET, JAYA, JAYA BARU, JEUMPA, JOHAN PAHWALAN, KAWAY XVI, KEMBANG TANJONG, KEUMALA, KLUET TENGAH, KLUET TIMUR, KOTA BAHAGIA, KOTA BAHARU, KOTA COT GLIE, KOTA JANTHO, KOTA SIGLI, KRUENG BARONA JAYA, KRUENG SABEE, KUALA, KUALA BARU, KUALA BATEE, KUALA PESISIR, KUTA ALAM, KUTA BARO, KUTA MALAKA, KUTA RAJA, KUTAPANJANG, LAWE ALAS, LAWE BULAN, LAWE SIGALA-GALA, LAWE SUMUR, LEMBAH SABIL, LEMBAH SEULAWAH, LEUPUNG, LEUSER, LHOKNGA, LHOONG, LONGKIB, LUENG BATA, MANE, MANGGENG, MESJID RAYA, MEURAXA, MEUREUBO, MILA, MONTASIK, MUARA TIGA, MUTIARA, MUTIARA TIMUR, NISAM ANTARA, PADANG TIJI, PANTE CEUREUMEN, PANTERAJA, PANTON REU, PEGASING, PENANGGALAN, PEUKAN BADA, PEUKAN BARO, PIDIE, PINING, PULAU BANYAK BARAT, PULO ACEH, PUTERI BETUNG, RIKIT GAIB, RUNDENG, RUSIP ANTARA, SAKTI, SAMATIGA, SAMPOINIET, SEKERAK, SEMADAM, SERBAJADI, SETIA, SETIA BHAKTI, SEULIMEUM, SEUNAGAN, SEUNAGAN TIMUR, SIMPANG JERNIH, SIMPANG KANAN, SIMPANG KIRI, SIMPANG TIGA, SIMPANG TIGA, SINGKIL, SINGKIL UTARA, SINGKOHOR, SUKA MAKMUE, SUKAJAYA, SUKAKARYA, SUKAMAKMUR, SUNGAI MAS, SURO MAKMUR, SUSOH, SYIAH KUALA, TADU RAYA, TAMIANG HULU, TANGAN-TANGAN, TANGSE, TANOH ALAS, TENGGULUN, TIRO/TRUSEB, TITEUE, TRIENGGADENG, TRIPA MAKMUR, TRUMON, TRUMON TENGAH, TRUMON TIMUR, ULEE KARENG, WOYLA, WOYLA BARAT, WOYLA TIMUR.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 25 October 2026, 20:05 WIB.', 'Aceh', 'https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CAH20261025005_alert.xml', 'Met', '2026-10-25 09:34:00', '2026-10-25 09:44:00', '2026-10-25 13:05:00', '["2.923,97.515 2.912,97.500 2.922,97.482 2.925,97.444 2.934,97.425 2.960,97.397 3.002,97.446 3.011,97.463 2.965,97.505 2.955,97.508 2.937,97.507 2.923,97.515", "2.815,97.717 2.785,97.745 2.787,97.766 2.669,97.817 2.653,97.814 2.637,97.825 2.597,97.812 2.547,97.795 2.509,97.792 2.500,97.791 2.449,97.754 2.419,97.727 2.408,97.708 2.395,97.665 2.402,97.661 2.473,97.655 2.589,97.654 2.678,97.648 2.829,97.615 2.879,97.592 2.881,97.592 2.879,97.654 2.847,97.678 2.833,97.701 2.815,97.717", "3.395,97.441 3.219,97.415 3.218,97.404 3.191,97.400 3.174,97.388 3.166,97.387 3.171,97.374 3.187,97.368 3.177,97.364 3.202,97.317 3.213,97.333 3.201,97.343 3.230,97.332 3.247,97.314 3.332,97.278 3.343,97.271 3.377,97.249 3.421,97.234 3.483,97.266 3.501,97.264 3.517,97.268 3.539,97.280 3.580,97.281 3.599,97.295 3.626,97.358 3.641,97.373 3.638,97.383 3.619,97.404 3.624,97.419 3.639,97.433 3.634,97.450 3.627,97.458 3.576,97.469 3.562,97.483 3.552,97.484 3.545,97.480 3.540,97.452 3.453,97.398 3.422,97.424 3.395,97.441", "3.099,97.559 3.084,97.524 3.080,97.454 3.078,97.436 3.066,97.419 3.075,97.401 3.066,97.385 3.067,97.366 3.074,97.351 3.082,97.343 3.129,97.398 3.155,97.395 3.166,97.387 3.174,97.388 3.191,97.400 3.218,97.404 3.219,97.415 3.395,97.441 3.331,97.473 3.285,97.467 3.268,97.469 3.241,97.470 3.214,97.480 3.168,97.520 3.150,97.551 3.127,97.575 3.099,97.559", "2.942,97.606 2.941,97.607 2.940,97.607 2.939,97.